{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u300aLeap Tactics\u300b</strong>   <br>A pixel-art platform puzzle game where <strong>all mechanisms are controlled by your jumps</strong>. Combine jumping actions with interactive mechanics to cleverly unravel the path to the goal.The demo includes the first 21 levels from the full version, with an estimated playtime of 1\u20132 hours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Core Mechanics</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Your character has a unique activation zone. If this zone overlaps with a mechanism while jumping, the mechanism's state will toggle.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683720/extras/\u6838\u5fc3\u73a9\u6cd5\u5c55\u793a.gif?t=1746024379\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Mechanism Examples</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blocks that appear/disappear after jumps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683720/extras/\u7816\u5757.gif?t=1746024379\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Claws that switch between ascending/descending</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683720/extras/\u5347\u964d\u722a.gif?t=1746024379\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spiked blocks rotating clockwise post-jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683720/extras/\u523a\u7816.gif?t=1746024379\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ladders extending/retracting with jumps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683720/extras/\u68af\u5b50.gif?t=1746024379\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A companion that jumps in sync with you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683720/extras/\u8df3\u8dc3.gif?t=1746024379\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Worried about platforming difficulty?</strong> <br>Fear not! The game minimizes precise platforming demands. With an undo function, you can undo any jump instantly, focusing purely on puzzle-solving. Accessible even to platforming novices.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683720/extras/\u64a4\u9500.gif?t=1746024379\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Content Overview</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10+ jump-activated mechanisms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">80+ handcrafted levels with a gentle difficulty curve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hidden challenge levels (with hints) for hardcore players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easter egg stages scattered in the game world</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3683720?t=1746024379","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3683720?t=1746024379","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683720/8a7fe4491059cd0c06a28a6bdf2ff731ae14f372/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746024379","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683720/8a7fe4491059cd0c06a28a6bdf2ff731ae14f372/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746024379","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u300aLeap Tactics\u300b</strong>   <br>A pixel-art platform puzzle game where <strong>all mechanisms are controlled by your jumps</strong>. Combine jumping actions with interactive mechanics to cleverly unravel the path to the goal.The demo includes the first 21 levels from the full version, with an estimated playtime of 1\u20132 hours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Core Mechanics</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Your character has a unique activation zone. If this zone overlaps with a mechanism while jumping, the mechanism's state will toggle.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683720/extras/\u6838\u5fc3\u73a9\u6cd5\u5c55\u793a.gif?t=1746024379\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Mechanism Examples</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blocks that appear/disappear after jumps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683720/extras/\u7816\u5757.gif?t=1746024379\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Claws that switch between ascending/descending</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683720/extras/\u5347\u964d\u722a.gif?t=1746024379\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spiked blocks rotating clockwise post-jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683720/extras/\u523a\u7816.gif?t=1746024379\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ladders extending/retracting with jumps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683720/extras/\u68af\u5b50.gif?t=1746024379\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A companion that jumps in sync with you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683720/extras/\u8df3\u8dc3.gif?t=1746024379\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Worried about platforming difficulty?</strong> <br>Fear not! The game minimizes precise platforming demands. With an undo function, you can undo any jump instantly, focusing purely on puzzle-solving. Accessible even to platforming novices.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683720/extras/\u64a4\u9500.gif?t=1746024379\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Content Overview</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10+ jump-activated mechanisms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">80+ handcrafted levels with a gentle difficulty curve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hidden challenge levels (with hints) for hardcore players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easter egg stages scattered in the game world</p></li></ul>","developers":["Mingri Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3549150","name":"\u8df3\u8df3\u4e3a\u8425/Leap Tactics"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683720/105213e7dad07b2672bdfb3ff164a2ffdcc331d8/header.jpg?t=1746024379","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OSX 10.8+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.5GHZ +<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1024 MB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257127976,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127976/movie480.mp4?t=1745447146","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127976/movie_max.mp4?t=1745447146"},"name":"mechanism intro","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257127976/2878a35131dca415990f8ebeb2c5112a19d47722/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745447146","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127976/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745447146","max":"http://video.akam